son-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, and in 2025 it landed at 42%, with August to September 2025 at 46%. January to February 2026 started off at 43% on the middle. Grid 21757 had its driest year in 1976 at 57%.</p>"}
